# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend (Vite). Copy to .env.local — that file is gitignored.
# Everything VITE_-prefixed is compiled into the browser bundle and is public.
# Never put a secret here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of the deployed serverless functions (api/ + canteen-backend/).
# Payments, staff login and the admin routes are switched off while this is unset.
# Local development: http://localhost:3000
VITE_PAYMENT_API_BASE_URL=

# Razorpay publishable key id — rzp_test_... while developing.
# Public by design (it cannot capture a payment on its own), but it identifies YOUR
# merchant account, so it is read from here rather than hardcoded.
# Checkout stays disabled while this is unset.
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=

# Optional overrides — only needed if a route does not sit under the base URL above.
# VITE_RAZORPAY_ORDER_API_URL=
# VITE_RAZORPAY_VERIFY_API_URL=
# VITE_FOOD_ASSISTANT_API_URL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server side. Set these in the Vercel project's environment variables,
# NOT in any VITE_ variable and NOT in a file that gets committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_xxxxxxxxxxxx
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Firebase Admin SDK service account, as one-line JSON, from
# Firebase console → Project settings → Service accounts → Generate new private key.
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=

# Optional: enables the Gemini interpreter in front of the deterministic NLU.
# Without it the Food Assistant runs on the rule-based parser alone — which is the
# tested path, not a degraded one.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
